00:01:36.660 --> 00:01:38.570
Happy New Year!

00:01:38.740 --> 00:01:39.990
<b>New Year's Day</b>

00:01:53.900 --> 00:01:56.560
I hope for your continued good will in the coming year, as well!

00:02:00.570 --> 00:02:03.360
P-Please!

00:02:13.230 --> 00:02:16.890
A-And I look forward to yours.

00:02:18.160 --> 00:02:21.610
It's kinda embarrassing to do this so formally.

00:02:21.610 --> 00:02:23.790
What are you saying, Suguru?!

00:02:29.660 --> 00:02:33.520
January 1st isn't just any old day out of the 365 in a year!

00:02:33.840 --> 00:02:35.820
It's a special day where we greet the beginning...

00:02:35.820 --> 00:02:38.140
...of the new year with reserved, sincere emotion!

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:44.010
Y-Yeah, you're right. This is our first New Year's together.

00:02:44.310 --> 00:02:48.390
And so, let's work hard in the coming year!

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:49.230
Hard!

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:53.980
I-I'm sorry...

00:02:56.400 --> 00:02:57.610
<b>Congratulations! First Trip of the Year!</b>

00:02:57.820 --> 00:03:04.740
