00:03:08.770 --> 00:03:10.590
You shouldn't say "<i>good morning</i>", Mahoro!

00:03:10.940 --> 00:03:12.250
On New Year's, you say...

00:03:12.430 --> 00:03:13.380
Happy...

00:03:13.470 --> 00:03:14.390
...New...

00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:16.160
