Ms. Shikijo!

00:03:45.510 --> 00:03:49.330
Don't pray for something that you won't get even if the Earth splits in two!

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:53.130
Don't go to a shrine and ask to have your dirty, carnal prayers fulfilled!

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:58.170
<b>The Expected First Battle at the New Year's Temple Visit</b>

00:03:58.390 --> 00:04:02.100
Say what?! I'm gonna make you cry at the starting bell, you flat-chested maid!

