00:04:05.980 --> 00:04:06.720
These?

00:04:07.090 --> 00:04:08.860
Do these look like CG to you, sister?!

00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:11.350
You call these polygons?!

00:04:11.570 --> 00:04:14.670
I-I'm not jealous of those at all!

00:04:14.820 --> 00:04:17.330
You 2D girl!

00:04:17.410 --> 00:04:18.910
You wanna go at it this year?!

00:04:18.910 --> 00:04:20.310
You want a piece of me this year?!

00:04:21.480 --> 00:04:23.670
I can't believe Mahoro and Ms. Shikijo.

00:04:23.670 --> 00:04:26.360
It's like they're resembling each other more and more.

00:04:26.480 --> 00:04:29.950
Big sister and Ms. Shikijo... All they do is fight.

