00:05:31.210 --> 00:05:31.800
What's the matter?

00:05:32.590 --> 00:05:36.110
H-Hey, sweet sake! Look, look! Let's have some! Okay?

00:05:38.220 --> 00:05:39.060
Sake?

00:05:39.160 --> 00:05:42.030
I-It's okay, there's no alcohol in it!

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:52.240
<b>SAY IT</b>

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:51.920
Say it! I've got to say it... Now's my chance!

00:05:51.410 --> 00:05:53.830
<b>SAY IT</b>

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:53.780
Effort! Courage! Guts! Victory!

00:05:54.840 --> 00:05:56.320
Listen, Minawa!

00:05:56.830 --> 00:05:58.140
I... I...

00:05:59.130 --> 00:06:00.990
I... I...

00:06:02.780 --> 00:06:04.070
Minawa?

00:06:04.200 --> 00:06:06.750
I'm sorry. I've got the hiccups...

00:06:07.280 --> 00:06:08.420
Hiccups?

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:10.920
Are you okay, Minawa?

00:06:11.490 --> 00:06:13.130
What should I do? What should I do?!

00:06:13.250 --> 00:06:14.620
What's he doing?

00:06:14.620 --> 00:06:16.580
We help set him up, and he blows it.

00:06:16.580 --> 00:06:19.600
And he calls himself a sharp-dressed playboy... 
He's all talk.

00:06:20.140 --> 00:06:25.330
Hamaji's all talk! Hamaji's pathetic!

00:06:20.220 --> 00:06:22.640
How long have you been standing there?!

00:06:22.850 --> 00:06:24.610
This ain't no peepshow!

00:06:24.670 --> 00:06:25.650
Hey! Get lost! Beat it!

00:06:25.650 --> 00:06:26.860
<b>January 2nd</b>

00:06:27.330 --> 00:06:29.990
Nothing says New Year's like pounding rice cakes!

00:06:31.550 --> 00:06:34.430
Still, you don't usually pound 'em during the first three days of the new year...

00:06:34.540 --> 00:06:37.660
Well, we had made a lot of them, but...

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:40.840
Ozouni! Ozouni! Ozouni!

00:06:40.980 --> 00:06:41.910
And that's why.

00:06:42.040 --> 00:06:43.070
That's why, huh?

00:06:43.280 --> 00:06:46.100
Minawa, just stop when you think we've got enough.

00:06:46.520 --> 00:06:47.550
O-Okay!

00:06:50.760 --> 00:06:52.310
Whack-a-Maid!

00:06:54.710 --> 00:06:56.820
This is more fun than I thought!

00:06:57.120 --> 00:06:59.860
W-What did you say? Whack a <i>WHAT</i> ?

00:06:59.920 --> 00:07:02.620
Oh, that's just what we shout back where I come from.

00:07:02.620 --> 00:07:03.700
Did I hurt your feelings?

00:07:09.960 --> 00:07:11.590
Mammary Monster!

00:07:12.770 --> 00:07:14.650
What?! What did you say?!

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:16.830
That's just what we shout where I come from.

00:07:16.960 --> 00:07:18.530
Oh, I see...

00:07:21.050 --> 00:07:22.580
Whack-a-Maid!

00:07:22.580 --> 00:07:24.170
Mammary Monster!

00:07:24.870 --> 00:07:26.020
Talk about intense...

00:07:26.220 --> 00:07:28.620
I think that's why the pounded rice cakes here taste so good.

00:07:29.870 --> 00:07:31.170
Huh? Minawa?

00:07:34.680 --> 00:07:35.890
<b>January 3rd</b>

00:07:37.990 --> 00:07:41.110
It's gorgeous! It's fantastic! It's elegant!

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:45.100
Rin's comes from a famous old military family...

00:07:45.100 --> 00:07:47.350
...that traces its roots all the way back to Genji Nasu!

00:07:49.040 --> 00:07:50.720
Welcome to our humble home.

00:07:51.100 --> 00:07:54.430
It's magnificent! It's ancestral! It's such good breeding!

00:07:55.520 --> 00:07:58.650
Nothing says New Year's like 100 Poems by 100 Poets!

00:07:58.830 --> 00:07:59.820
Now listen, you...

00:08:01.560 --> 00:08:03.040
"<i>To the dim cottage,</i>"

00:08:03.280 --> 00:08:04.880
"<i>...overgrown with thick-leaved vines...</i>"

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:06.520
"<i>...in its loneliness...</i>"

00:08:06.720 --> 00:08:08.450
"<i>...comes the dreary autumn time,</i>"

00:08:08.680 --> 00:08:10.590
"<i>...but there no people come.</i>"

00:08:25.360 --> 00:08:28.890
Tell me there are lots of these! Tell me this was just a good copy!

00:08:29.140 --> 00:08:32.110
I think that was a white china vase from the Song dynasty, but don't worry about it.

00:08:32.300 --> 00:08:33.650
We're insured.

00:08:34.260 --> 00:08:35.560
Let's continue, okay?

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:36.840
"<i>When I take the path...</i>"

00:08:36.840 --> 00:08:37.360
Got it!

00:08:36.840 --> 00:08:37.360
Got it!

00:08:37.540 --> 00:08:38.690
"<i>The spring has passed...</i>"

00:08:38.690 --> 00:08:39.110
Got it!

00:08:38.690 --> 00:08:39.110
Got it!

00:08:39.260 --> 00:08:40.350
"<i>Oh, the foot-drawn trail...</i>"

00:08:40.350 --> 00:08:40.960
Got it!

00:08:40.350 --> 00:08:40.960
Got it!

00:08:41.230 --> 00:08:46.240
Impressive... That teacher's certificate of yours isn't just for show, I see.

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:49.550
And you... You aren't your average maid.

00:08:50.010 --> 00:08:50.830
But!

00:08:51.100 --> 00:08:52.370
Okay, here's the next one.

00:08:52.370 --> 00:08:54.310
I-I know you said not to worry, but still...

00:08:54.310 --> 00:08:55.780
If this keeps up...

00:08:56.130 --> 00:08:59.040
It's hopeless. No one can stop those two now.

00:08:59.190 --> 00:09:01.940
But if you don't stop them, Suguru, who will?!

00:09:01.940 --> 00:09:03.350
That's easy for you to say...!

00:09:03.730 --> 00:09:05.080
I-I'll do it.

00:09:06.060 --> 00:09:07.510
"<i>Even when the gods...</i>"

00:09:07.720 --> 00:09:09.520
"<i>...held sway in the ancient days,</i>"

00:09:09.750 --> 00:09:11.310
"<i>...I have heard...</i>"

00:09:12.890 --> 00:09:14.380
Got it!

00:09:12.890 --> 00:09:14.380
Got it!

00:09:22.400 --> 00:09:23.560
MINAWA!

00:09:23.820 --> 00:09:25.300
Are you all right, Minawa?!

00:09:28.170 --> 00:09:28.890
What's the matter?

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:30.250
I-It's nothing.

00:09:30.850 --> 00:09:34.370
I-I guess this house of yours makes me a little nervous, Rin.

00:09:35.120 --> 00:09:36.570
There's something my father always tells me.

00:09:37.490 --> 00:09:40.480
"A noble house's traditions and the values of the people in it are two different things."

00:09:41.140 --> 00:09:43.290
"I want you to be able to differentiate between the two."

00:09:44.550 --> 00:09:45.520
I'm me.

00:09:46.070 --> 00:09:47.880
What's inside me isn't going to change.

00:09:49.410 --> 00:09:50.910
You're pretty amazing, Rin.

00:09:51.200 --> 00:09:53.660
Y-You really think so? Anybody would do the same.

00:09:54.070 --> 00:09:54.910
Minawa!

00:09:56.830 --> 00:09:57.820
What's wrong?!

00:09:57.900 --> 00:09:59.640
It's Minawa! She...!

00:09:59.640 --> 00:10:01.010
The koi! The koi!

